    {
      "text": "#Function to get data from Zetaris by passing the select query.\n\ndef SelectQuery(select_query):\n    page_limit \u003d 100\n    x \u003d open_sql_query(select_query,page_limit)\n    data \u003d x[\u0027records\u0027]\n    query_token \u003d x[\u0027queryToken\u0027]\n    max_pages \u003d x[\u0027totalPages\u0027]\n    for i in range(2,max_pages+1):\n        page_data\u003dpage_sql_query(query_token,page_limit,i)\n        data +\u003d page_data[\u0027records\u0027]\n    return data",
      "user": "ARJUN.SHARMA@ZETARIS.COM",
